\f2\fs32 *Principle: Decentralized, underground nutrient exchange.*\'a0\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs32 Install no-dig, micro-tunnels beneath sidewalks at key intersections. Seniors pull a mechanical cord at a street-level portal, which sends a low-friction nylon shuttle carrying a folded walker or cane through the tunnel to a different portal (e.g., across a wide, dangerous street). Borrows fungal \'93shortcut\'94 logic to bypass hazardous surface barriers.
