\f2\fs32 *Model:* A community-based learning web where any person (child or adult) can offer a skill and request another. No central curriculum. A \'93learning request\'94 (e.g., \'93I need to fix a bicycle chain\'94) is routed through the network until someone nearby offers it. That exchange generates credit, which the receiver can later spend on another skill. The system self-regulates like a nutrient economy.
