\f2\fs32 \cf0 **2. Ant Colony Optimization (Biology/Logistics) \'96 Stigmergic Learning Trails**\'a0\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f2\fs32 *Principle:* Ants leave pheromone trails; stronger trails attract more ants, optimizing paths without central control.\'a0\'a0
