\f2\fs32 *Model:* Learners leave \'93conceptual trails\'94 (physical tokens, chalk marks, or shared notebooks) after mastering a difficult idea. Others follow the densest trails, which represent the most effective learning paths. Trails decay if unused, forcing constant updating. Over time, the community\'92s collective intelligence creates emergent curricula without teachers or timetables.
